ives together with her parents, her grandparents and her elder sister in a little town. In school, she has many friends with whom she studies and plays together everyday, including her close pal, Tama-chan; the student committee members, Maruo-kun and Migiwa-san; and the B-class trio: 'little master' Hanawa-kun, Hamaji-Bu Taro and Sekiguchi-kun. This is a fun-loving and enjoyable anime that portrays the simple things in life. (Source: ANN)","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"132982","ru":"Σασμός","en":"Σασμός","year":"2021","type":"Сериал","rating":8.5,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/laSxkaKDlcuvji79ge6VHvGcaST.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1483546","ru":"Book of Joshua: Walls of Jericho","en":"Book of Joshua: Walls of Jericho","year":"2025","type":"Мультфильм","rating":8.5,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zu54drUl5ZPSTrTOHSuFnImMz4A.jpg","genres":["мультфильм","приключения"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1305155","ru":"爆上戦隊ブンブンジャー 劇場BOON！ プロミス・ザ・サーキット","en":"爆上戦隊ブンブンジャー 劇場BOON！ プロミス・ザ・サーキット","year":"2024","type":"Фильм","rating":8.5,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uZPu1Mp30ykl31CTrsMV19LrdB1.jpg","genres":["боевик","фантастика"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"292189","ru":"Nepobaby","en":"Nepobaby","year":"2025","type":"Сериал","rating":8.5,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9aepIJg1PGd5DD6rgdVp1gG63YQ.jpg","genres":["комедия","драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1245119","ru":"Cravata galbenă","en":"Cravata galbenă","year":"2025","type":"Фильм","rating":8.5,"vot